f\">Dwarves</a> A dwarf miner never retreats.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-strategy\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Strategy\">Strategy</span></h3>\n<p>\tBring <a href=\"#/wiki/Box\">boxes</a> or <a href=\"#/wiki/Honey%20Flower\">Honey Flowers</a> to block them, so that you don't get hit by more than 2 at once.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Loot\">Loot</span></h3>\n<p><small><i>Drop rates are estimated based on 345 samples <span class=\"loot-stats-link\">(Loot Statistics)</span>.</i></small> <small><i>Colour-coding is applied after 500 samples — current sample size is below this threshold.</i></small><br/><small><i>Task column indicates items used in delivery tasks.</i></small>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"text-align:center; width:auto;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th></th>\n<th>Item</th>\n<th>Task</th>\n<th>Quantity</th>\n<th>Avg</th>\n<th data-sort-type=\"number\">%\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"loot-table-icon\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\"><img alt=\"Gold Coin\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gold_Coin_a5b511.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></span></td>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a></td>\n<td></td>\n<td>1-10</td>\n<td>2.0</td>\n<td class=\"\" data-sort-value=\"41.159420\" style=\"text-align:center;\">41%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td><i>Empty</i></td>\n<td></td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>0.38</td>\n<td class=\"\" data-sort-value=\"37.971014\" style=\"text-align:center;\">38%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"loot-table-icon\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Axe\"><img alt=\"Axe\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Axe_fe694f.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></span></td>\n<td><a